# ---- Secrets & infrastructure state (repo-wide; see docs/terraform-state-security.md) ----
# Terraform state, plans, crash logs, working dirs (anywhere in the repo)
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.json
tfplan
tfplan.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Variable/backends with real values (committed examples are re-included)
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
!infra/terraform/envs/*.tfvars
!infra/terraform/parameters/clients/*.sample.tfvars.json
backend.hcl
!backend.hcl.example
# Environment files (examples are committed)
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
